WEBVTT

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:33.309
and less depression
over the course of the six-month study.

00:11:33.333 --> 00:11:34.857
When you're going through grief,

00:11:34.881 --> 00:11:37.351
you might need a reminder,

00:11:37.375 --> 00:11:40.476
or you might need permission
to feel grateful.

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:43.268
In our kitchen, we've got
a bright pink neon poster

00:11:43.292 --> 00:11:46.726
that reminds us to "accept" the good.

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.518
In the American army,

00:11:48.542 --> 00:11:50.601
they framed it a little bit differently.

00:11:50.625 --> 00:11:54.809
They talked to the army
about hunting the good stuff.

00:11:54.833 --> 00:11:56.726
Find the language that works for you,

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.059
but whatever you do,

00:11:58.083 --> 00:12:02.393
make an intentional,
deliberate, ongoing effort